 StartServ;app
⍝ Starts the star map animation web server on port 8080, and serves for ever
⍝ Needs Stark linked as #.Stark, and Starmap loaded with Data set and
⍝ Initialise run, for example:
⍝   gritt -l -link 'sm:APLSource' -link 'Starmap:Starmap' -link 'Stark:~/dev/Stark/APLSource'
⍝     -e 'Starmap.Data←sm ⋄ Starmap.Initialise ⋄ Starmap.StartServ'
 app←⎕NEW WebApp(##.Stark.Stark ⎕THIS)
 app.Start 8080
 :While 1 ⋄ ⎕DL 3600 ⋄ :EndWhile
